<title>BELGIUM: NEW DIRECTOR APPOINTED AT GIB GROUP.</title>
<headline>NEW DIRECTOR APPOINTED AT GIB GROUP.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian retailer GIB Group said on Wednesday that Jean-Louis Raymond will join the company in November as a general director responsible for day-to-day management of group activities.</p>
<p>GIB Group said he brings more than 30 years international experience in marketing and management of retail companies.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
